{"4023590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neon Dreams", "steam_appid": 4023590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4833020], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the life of an aspiring arms dealer in a Cyberpunk city. Complete thrilling bullet-hell combat simulations with your trusty battle mech, while managing your high-stakes business. Drink coffee, buy weapons, collect stickers, and overcome difficult battle modifiers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying Movement and Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the simulated environment, your mech responds flawlessly to your command. Push the machine to its limits as you navigate complex terrain, while engaging in bullet-hell battles with swarms of enemies. Time your rolls to negate incoming damage, or use them to get to a favorable position. The movement and gunplay is easy to learn, but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/a056fc9a11ce41abfb79c9133cc4d684.avif?t=1781487225\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Weapons and Enemies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ weapons, bullets, abilities, and weapon attachments. Find your own fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the weaknesses of a cast of unique enemies, and adapt your arsenal and strategy to strike them down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As more expensive contracts come your way, the enemies grow stronger and gain new abilities. No two battles are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 hand-crafted battles and 3 storylines spread across 3 worlds, each with unique game modes and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with endless loadout possibilities. Get creative with whatever you have in stock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/0d42df153705b9fc4600eb87e4591f9c.avif?t=1781487225\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do business with whacky characters living in this Cyberpunk world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble for stickers that permanently enhance your mech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink futuristic beverages that enhance your combat abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your relationships with friends and business partners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game plus offers new challenges, and game-changing stickers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy office with a beautiful soundtrack and customizable wallpaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/40ab42e68f948c14645030a688f581b8.poster.avif?t=1781487225\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/40ab42e68f948c14645030a688f581b8.webm?t=1781487225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/40ab42e68f948c14645030a688f581b8.mp4?t=1781487225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the life of an aspiring arms dealer in a Cyberpunk city. Complete thrilling bullet-hell combat simulations with your trusty battle mech, while managing your high-stakes business. Drink coffee, buy weapons, collect stickers, and overcome difficult battle modifiers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying Movement and Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the simulated environment, your mech responds flawlessly to your command. Push the machine to its limits as you navigate complex terrain, while engaging in bullet-hell battles with swarms of enemies. Time your rolls to negate incoming damage, or use them to get to a favorable position. The movement and gunplay is easy to learn, but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/a056fc9a11ce41abfb79c9133cc4d684.avif?t=1781487225\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Weapons and Enemies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ weapons, bullets, abilities, and weapon attachments. Find your own fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the weaknesses of a cast of unique enemies, and adapt your arsenal and strategy to strike them down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As more expensive contracts come your way, the enemies grow stronger and gain new abilities. No two battles are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 hand-crafted battles and 3 storylines spread across 3 worlds, each with unique game modes and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with endless loadout possibilities. Get creative with whatever you have in stock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/0d42df153705b9fc4600eb87e4591f9c.avif?t=1781487225\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do business with whacky characters living in this Cyberpunk world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble for stickers that permanently enhance your mech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink futuristic beverages that enhance your combat abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your relationships with friends and business partners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game plus offers new challenges, and game-changing stickers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy office with a beautiful soundtrack and customizable wallpaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/40ab42e68f948c14645030a688f581b8.poster.avif?t=1781487225\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/40ab42e68f948c14645030a688f581b8.webm?t=1781487225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/40ab42e68f948c14645030a688f581b8.mp4?t=1781487225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Live the life of an aspiring arms dealer in a Cyberpunk city. Complete thrilling bullet-hell combat simulations with your trusty battle mech, while managing your high-stakes business. Drink coffee, buy weapons, collect stickers, and overcome difficult battle modifiers.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/027971a83d266721dc3f295990ffdaa04a2076d6/header.jpg?t=1781487225", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/d315f82efe9555b59ed1f27efbf1696f2876b09a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781487225", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/d315f82efe9555b59ed1f27efbf1696f2876b09a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781487225", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4